    "/api/public/v1/agent": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Retrieves all agents belonging to the current tenant.\r\n            \r\n## Authorization\r\nAccess is secured using a public API key.\r\n            \r\n## Response Structure\r\nEach agent contains:\r\n- **id** (required): Unique identifier of the agent.\r\n- **name** (required): Display name of the agent.\r\n- **agentType** (required): Type of agent (Coaching, AskItero, or DataCapture).\r\n- **tenantId** (required): ID of the tenant this agent belongs to.\r\n- **interactionType** (optional): Type of interaction this agent supports.\r\n  - `0` – Voice\r\n  - `1` – Chat\r\n            \r\n## Agent Types\r\nNumeric enum values representing agent types:\r\n- **0** – Coaching Agent\r\n- **1** – Ask Itero Agent\r\n- **2** – Data Capture Agent\r\n            \r\n## Interaction Type\r\nIndicates the communication channel the agent is designed to handle:\r\n- **Voice (0)**: Agent handles voice call interactions (phone/video calls).\r\n- **Chat (1)**: Agent handles text-based chat interactions.\r\nWhen assigning agents to a scorecard template, ensure the agent's interaction type matches the scorecard's interaction type.\r\n            \r\n## Example Response\r\n```json\r\n[\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": 1,\r\n    \"name\": \"Sales Coaching Agent\",\r\n    \"agentType\": 0,\r\n    \"tenantId\": 10,\r\n    \"interactionType\": 0\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": 2,\r\n    \"name\": \"Data Capture Agent\",\r\n    \"agentType\": 2,\r\n    \"tenantId\": 10,\r\n    \"interactionType\": 1\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n```\r\n            \r\n## Notes\r\n- Only agents belonging to the current tenant are returned.\r\n- The list may be empty if no agents are configured for the tenant.\r\n- Agents are used to power different features within the Itero platform.\r\n- **Important:** Agents must be matched with scorecard templates that have the same interaction type (Voice agents with Voice scorecards, Chat agents with Chat scorecards).",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Itero.Tenant.Api.Application.Dtos.PublicApi.PublicAgentDto"
                  },
                  "type": "array"
                }
              },
              "text/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Itero.Tenant.Api.Application.Dtos.PublicApi.PublicAgentDto"
                  },
                  "type": "array"
                }
              },
              "text/plain": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Itero.Tenant.Api.Application.Dtos.PublicApi.PublicAgentDto"
                  },
                  "type": "array"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Agents were successfully retrieved."
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ProblemDetails"
                }
              },
              "text/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ProblemDetails"
                }
              },
              "text/plain": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Unauthorized — user is not authenticated."
          },
          "403": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ProblemDetails"
                }
              },
              "text/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ProblemDetails"
                }
              },
              "text/plain": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Forbidden — API key does not have sufficient permissions."
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal server error."
          }
        },
        "summary": "Retrieves all agents associated with the current tenant.",
        "tags": [
          "PublicAgent"
        ]
      }
    },
