    "/api/public/v1/get-users": {
      "get": {
        "description": " Retrieves users belonging to the current tenant, optionally filtered by user role.\r\n\r\n ## Authorization\r\n Access is secured using a public API key. Include the API key in the request headers:\r\n ```http\r\n X-API-Key: your-public-api-key\r\n ```\r\n \r\n ## Query Parameters\r\n - **role** (optional): Filters users by role.\r\n   - Allowed values:\r\n     - `Representative`\r\n     - `Manager`\r\n     - `Coach`\r\n     - `Owner`\r\n   - If not provided, users of **all roles** are returned.\r\n- **isActive** (optional): Filters users by status active.\r\n   - Allowed values:\r\n     - `true`\r\n     - `false`\r\n   - If not provided, all users are returned.\r\n ## Response Structure\r\n Each user contains:\r\n - **id** (required): Unique identifier of the user.\r\n - **tenantUserId** (required): Identifier of the user within the current tenant.\r\n - **createdDate** (required): Date and time when the user was created (UTC).\r\n - **name** (required): Full name of the user.\r\n - **role** (required): Role assigned to the user.\r\n - **email** (required): Email address of the user.\r\n - **isActive** (required): Status of the user\r\n \r\n ## Example Response\r\n ```json\r\n [\r\n   {\r\n     \"id\": 1,\r\n     \"tenantUserId\": 101,\r\n     \"createdDate\": \"2024-12-10T09:15:30Z\",\r\n     \"name\": \"John Doe\",\r\n     \"role\": \"Manager\",\r\n     \"isActive\" : \"true\",\r\n     \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\"\r\n   },\r\n   {\r\n     \"id\": 2,\r\n     \"tenantUserId\": 101,\r\n     \"createdDate\": \"2024-12-11T14:42:10Z\",\r\n     \"name\": \"Jane Smith\",\r\n     \"role\": \"Representative\",\r\n     \"isActive\" : \"true\",\r\n     \"email\": \"jane.smith@example.com\"\r\n   }\r\n ]\r\n ```\r\n \r\n ## Notes\r\n - Only users belonging to the current tenant are returned.\r\n - When the **role** parameter is specified, only users with that role are returned.\r\n - The list may be empty if no users match the criteria.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "role",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "style": "form"
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "isActive",
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "style": "form"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Itero.Tenant.Api.Application.Dtos.PublicApi.UserPublicDto"
                  },
                  "type": "array"
                }
              },
              "text/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Itero.Tenant.Api.Application.Dtos.PublicApi.UserPublicDto"
                  },
                  "type": "array"
                }
              },
              "text/plain": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Itero.Tenant.Api.Application.Dtos.PublicApi.UserPublicDto"
                  },
                  "type": "array"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Users were successfully retrieved."
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ProblemDetails"
                }
              },
              "text/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ProblemDetails"
                }
              },
              "text/plain": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ProblemDetails"
