      "post": {
        "description": "Creates a new user inside the current tenant.\r\n            \r\n## Authorization\r\nAccess is secured using a public API key.\r\n            \r\n## Required Fields\r\n- **name**: Full name of the user.\r\n- **email**: Email address of the user.\r\n- **role**: Role assigned to the user.\r\n  - Allowed values:\r\n    - `Representative`\r\n    - `Manager`\r\n    - `Coach`\r\n    - `Owner`\r\n            \r\n## Optional Fields\r\n- **isActive**: Whether the user is active. Defaults to `true`.\r\n- **groups**: List of user group names the user belongs to. Groups that do not yet exist for the tenant will be created automatically.\r\n            \r\n## Example Request\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\r\n  \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\r\n  \"role\": \"Representative\",\r\n  \"isActive\": true,\r\n  \"groups\": [\"Sales East\", \"VIP Accounts\"]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n            \r\n## Notes\r\n- The user will be associated with the current tenant.\r\n- If a user with the same email already exists in the tenant, the existing record will be reused.\r\n- An invitation email is sent to the user upon creation.\r\n- Activating a `Representative` or `Manager` consumes a billable seat and may be rejected if the tenant has reached its seat limit.",
